<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank fixes baht/dlr midrate at 25.74.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank fixes baht/dlr midrate at 25.74.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai central bank on Tuesday set the baht/dollar midrate at a five year high of 25.74 against a previous 25.71 on Monday.</p>
<p>The baht, which is traded in a daily range of two satang either side of the midrate, has steadily weakened against the dollar over recent weeks.</p>
</text>
